<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI in talks to sell Con Murchison stake.</title>
<headline>JCI in talks to sell Con Murchison stake.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African firm Consolidated Murchison Ltd said on Friday that talks are underway which could see mining house JCI Ltd sell its interest in the firm.</p>
<p>JCI is Consolidated Murchison's main shareholder.</p>
<p>The firm said that shareholders should use caution when dealing in its shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
